## Indicating success of an invoked Android native payment app ## {#sctn-indicate-success}

In order for an invoked Android application, |app|, to [=indicate success=]
back to the user agent, |app| performs the following steps:

1. Call <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/Activity#setResult(int)">Activity.setResult</a> with <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/Activity#RESULT_OK">Activity.RESULT_OK</a> and with an Intent containing:

    1. A "`methodName`" Intent extra, set to the string name of the method being used.

    1. A "`details`" Intent extra, set to a JSON string containing any
        payment-app specific result information.

1. Terminate the |app|'s activity, e.g. via <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/Activity#finish()">Activity.finish()</a>.

To [=retrieve the converted result details=], the user agent performs the
following steps:

1. Obtain the Intent bundle from the result via HOW

1. TODO - conversion steps

## Indicating user cancel from an invoked Android native payment app ## {#sctn-indicate-user-cancel}

In order for an invoked Android application, |app|, to [=indicate user cancellation=]
back to the user agent, |app| performs the following steps:

1. Call <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/Activity#setResult(int)">Activity.setResult</a> with <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/Activity#RESULT_CANCEL">Activity.RESULT_CANCEL</a>.

1. Terminate the |app|'s activity, e.g. via <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/Activity#finish()">Activity.finish()</a>.

## Indicating internal error from an invoked Android native payment app ## {#sctn-indicate-app-error}

In order for an invoked Android application, |app|, to [=indicate internal
error=] back to the user agent, |app| performs the following steps:

1. Let |RESULT_INTERNAL_ERROR| be equal to <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/Activity#RESULT_FIRST_USER">Activity.RESULT_FIRST_USER</a>.

1. Call <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/Activity#setResult(int)">Activity.setResult</a> with |RESULT_INTERNAL_ERROR|.

1. Terminate the |app|'s activity, e.g. via <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/Activity#finish()">Activity.finish()</a>.

## Creating an Android bundle ## {#sctn-creating-bundle}

To <dfn>create an Android bundle</dfn> from a {{PaymentRequest}}, |request|,
perform the following steps:

1. Let |bundle| be a new Bundle object.

1. Insert |request|.{{PaymentRequest/id}} into |bundle| with the key
     "`paymentRequestId`".

1. Insert the {{Document/title}} of |request|'s [=relevant global object=]'s
     [=associated Document=] into |bundle| with the key "`merchantName`".

1. Insert |request|.{{PaymentRequest/[[details]]}}.{{PaymentDetailsInit/total}}.{{PaymentItem/amount}}
     into |bundle| with the key "`total`".

     ISSUE: This needs to be serialized to JSON.

